{
  "name": "AI Chief of Staff — CoachingAdvice_TEMPLATE",
  "nodes": [
    {
      "id": "wh",
      "name": "Webhook (test)",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.webhook",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        0,
        -120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "path": "acos-coaching-advice",
        "httpMethod": "POST",
        "responseMode": "lastNode"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ewt",
      "name": "When Called by Dispatcher",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.executeWorkflowTrigger",
      "typeVersion": 1.1,
      "position": [
        0,
        120
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "inputSource": "passthrough"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "norm",
      "name": "Normalize Input",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        280,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "a1",
              "name": "transcript",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.transcript ?? $json.transcript }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a2",
              "name": "meeting_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.meeting_id ?? $json.meeting_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a3",
              "name": "run_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.run_id ?? $json.run_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "a4",
              "name": "tenant_id",
              "value": "={{ $json.body?.tenant_id ?? $json.tenant_id }}",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "readch",
      "name": "Read Coaching History",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        560,
        0
      ],
      "alwaysOutputData": true,
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "getAll",
        "tableId": "coaching_history",
        "returnAll": true,
        "filters": {
          "conditions": [
            {
              "keyName": "tenant_id",
              "condition": "eq",
              "keyValue": "={{ $('Normalize Input').item.json.tenant_id }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sortch",
      "name": "Sort by Recency",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.sort",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        780,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "type": "simple",
        "sortFieldsUi": {
          "sortField": [
            {
              "fieldName": "created_at",
              "order": "descending"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "limitch",
      "name": "Last 10",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.limit",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1000,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "maxItems": 10
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ctx",
      "name": "Build Coaching Context",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.code",
      "typeVersion": 2,
      "position": [
        1220,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "mode": "runOnceForAllItems",
        "language": "javaScript",
        "jsCode": "// Formatiert die (bereits per Supabase-Filter + Sort + Limit) gelieferten letzten Notizen.\nconst norm = $('Normalize Input').first().json;\nconst uuidRe = /^[0-9a-f]{8}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{4}-[0-9a-f]{12}$/i;\nconst run_id = uuidRe.test(String(norm.run_id || '')) ? norm.run_id : null;\nconst rows = $input.all().map(i => i.json).filter(r => r && r.advice);\nlet history_text;\nif (rows.length === 0) {\n  history_text = '(No prior coaching notes for this tenant.)';\n} else {\n  history_text = rows.map((r, i) => `--- Note ${i + 1} (${r.created_at}, meeting ${r.meeting_id}) ---\\n${r.advice}`).join('\\n\\n');\n}\nreturn [{ json: { transcript: norm.transcript, meeting_id: norm.meeting_id, run_id, tenant_id: norm.tenant_id, history_text, history_count: rows.length } }];"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "model",
      "name": "OpenAI Chat Model",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.lmChatOpenAi",
      "typeVersion": 1.3,
      "position": [
        1220,
        240
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "model": {
          "__rl": true,
          "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
          "mode": "list",
          "cachedResultName": "gpt-4o-mini"
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "agent",
      "name": "Generate Coaching Note",
      "type": "@n8n/n8n-nodes-langchain.agent",
      "typeVersion": 3,
      "position": [
        1460,
        0
      ],
      "retryOnFail": true,
      "maxTries": 2,
      "waitBetweenTries": 4000,
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=Meeting transcript:\n\n{{ $json.transcript }}\n\n---\nRecent coaching notes (most recent first):\n\n{{ $json.history_text }}",
        "options": {
          "systemMessage": "You are an internal sales coach for the operator running this workflow. You are given the transcript of a meeting the operator ran, plus recent coaching notes from prior meetings. Produce one focused coaching note for this meeting: name the single biggest strength the operator showed, the single most important area to improve, and one concrete, specific action for next time. Reference the prior coaching notes — call out repeated patterns and acknowledge progress where you see it. Be direct and practical. Write in the same language as the transcript. Output only the coaching note.\n\n// {{REPLACE_ME_COACHING_SYSTEM_PROMPT}}: customize this prompt. Add the operator's name, the sales context, the explicit traits you want the coach to weigh."
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "ins",
      "name": "Insert Coaching Row",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.supabase",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1680,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "operation": "create",
        "tableId": "coaching_history",
        "fieldsUi": {
          "fieldValues": [
            {
              "fieldId": "tenant_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Build Coaching Context').item.json.tenant_id }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "run_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Build Coaching Context').item.json.run_id }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "meeting_id",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $('Build Coaching Context').item.json.meeting_id }}"
            },
            {
              "fieldId": "advice",
              "fieldValue": "={{ $json.output }}"
            }
          ]
        }
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "fmt",
      "name": "Format Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.set",
      "typeVersion": 3.4,
      "position": [
        1900,
        0
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "assignments": {
          "assignments": [
            {
              "id": "o1",
              "name": "output",
              "value": "={{ $('Generate Coaching Note').item.json.output }}",
              "type": "string"
            },
            {
              "id": "o2",
              "name": "model",
              "value": "gpt-4o-mini",
              "type": "string"
            }
          ]
        },
        "options": {}
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-readme",
      "name": "README",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        -60,
        -260
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## AI Chief of Staff — CoachingAdvice_TEMPLATE\n\n**Was dieser Sub-Workflow tut.** Wird vom Dispatcher gerufen, liest die letzten Coaching-Notizen aus `coaching_history` (gefiltert auf deinen `tenant_id`), baut einen Kontext aus Transkript + Verlauf, generiert mit GPT-4o-mini eine fokussierte Coaching-Notiz (Stärke, Schwäche, konkrete nächste Aktion), schreibt sie zurück in `coaching_history`, gibt `{output, model}` an den Dispatcher zurück.\n\n**Was du einsetzen musst:** OpenAI-Credential im `OpenAI Chat Model`-Node. Supabase-Credential in `Read Coaching History` + `Insert Coaching Row`. Optional: System-Prompt in `Generate Coaching Note` anpassen.\n\n**Wichtig:** Wie bei ProFollowUp: lass den `Webhook (test)`-Trigger drin und aktiviere den Workflow.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 2100,
        "color": 6
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-memory",
      "name": "Das Gedächtnis",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        520,
        300
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Das Gedächtnis (komplett nativ)\n**Read Coaching History** liest `coaching_history`, **gefiltert auf deinen `tenant_id`** (nativer Supabase-Filter, kein Code). **Sort by Recency** sortiert nach `created_at` absteigend, **Last 10** behält die letzten zehn. **Build Coaching Context** (eine kleine Code-Node) formatiert daraus den `history_text` und fängt den Leer-Fall ab. Genau diese Kette macht aus dem System einen Chief of Staff statt einer Transkriptionsmaschine: die zweite Sitzung sieht die erste.",
        "height": 180,
        "width": 900,
        "color": 4
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-llm",
      "name": "LLM",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1180,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## LLM + Agent\n**Generate Coaching Note** = LangChain Agent + OpenAI Chat Model. Der System-Prompt ist der Sales-Coach. Ersetze die Platzhalter mit deinem Setup (Name, Sales-Kontext, gewünschte Coaching-Schwerpunkte).",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 420,
        "color": 5
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-schema",
      "name": "Schema-Hinweis: coaching_history",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1620,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Schema-Hinweis: coaching_history\n\n**Insert Coaching Row** schreibt nach: `tenant_id`, `run_id`, `meeting_id`, `advice`.\n\nDie mitgelieferte `schema.sql` im Bundle stimmt mit diesem Schema überein (kein `client_id`-Feld in v1). Sobald du den Workflow mehrere Wochen laufen lässt, ist `coaching_history` dein wertvollstes Asset: das per-tenant Gedächtnis, das mit jedem Call besser wird.",
        "height": 200,
        "width": 480,
        "color": 3
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "sticky-out",
      "name": "Output",
      "type": "n8n-nodes-base.stickyNote",
      "typeVersion": 1,
      "position": [
        1860,
        320
      ],
      "parameters": {
        "content": "## Output\n**Format Output** gibt `{output, model}` an den Dispatcher zurück.",
        "height": 120,
        "width": 220,
        "color": 5
      }
    }
  ],
  "connections": {
